{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9cf97c8c1bbd3ad46013304e27a0159e4a131c09e6bab1be1688b20773b0d2cb", "ja": "（ここ最近は、公演の準備で息つく暇もない。\n次は貴音の衣装の確認だな）", "zh": "（最近一直忙着准备公演，连喘口气的时间都没有。接下来该确认贵音的服装了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "f2a4b0ed9c45e5a2a24e7e1a6c78d885398db61c1927870f234523d44f741bc6", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\n衣装の方、すでに着替え終わっておりますよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n服装这边，我已经换好了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1002_p", "source_sha256": "601dbd218bf9ee760e53f499454ec160b3d4689757998e2c183d1522eea23d47", "ja": "遅くなってごめんな。どれどれ……うん！\nよく似合ってる。貴音の雰囲気にバッチリだな！", "zh": "抱歉来晚了。让我看看……嗯！很适合你。和贵音的气质太搭了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "66138d5b7e5eec17e4c3699e65359b0ea4344ae1ee2a6136b693413d057ba9db", "ja": "ありがとうございます。医者風の衣装と聞き、\nどのような雰囲気か、気になっておりましたが……。", "zh": "谢谢您。听说这套服装是医生风格时，\n我还在好奇究竟会是怎样的感觉呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "5ac68953353cffc3c73fe81458b0ce3cc20694558f1426fe0373d71690ed5ef2", "ja": "真、素敵に仕上げていただき、うれしい限りです。\nアイドルらしい可愛らしさもあり……おや？", "zh": "真是被打扮得十分漂亮，真让人高兴。\n既有偶像般的可爱……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7bab32b59b8dea2388635e6dad44394ae2dc3d5fde4e2f1f35ed1669c42a2482", "ja": "どうかしたのか？　貴音。", "zh": "怎么了？贵音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "d34eedb75ef85c0c16285f268f8cf2a152a0ed80ad4ab8bd9ae73fba28e39532", "ja": "……やはり。{$P$}、\n顔に疲れが出ていますよ。", "zh": "……果然如此。{$P$}，\n您的脸上带着疲态呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "916386d1050381d3cca64f514b70b1e51895d802ca4ced13efad81e3edbdfb53", "ja": "撮影や公演の準備で、お忙しそうでしたし。\nもしや、無理をされているのではありませんか？", "zh": "您似乎一直在忙着拍摄和准备公演。\n难道是勉强自己撑着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1008_p", "source_sha256": "74e6e60bf7fc69cc4338d173a17e9bdee86c8703a1a25762fd73a8e26252524e", "ja": "今、ちょっとバタバタしてて……。\nけど、よく気づいたな。", "zh": "我现在有点忙得团团转……不过，你还真注意到了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "09ce558b59b234da26694804e00f47b888ad7b3720a9ba5767e2f218ec70f7c1", "ja": "当然です。いつもあなた様を見ているのですから。\nたとえ隠されたとしても、見過ごすことはありません。", "zh": "这是理所当然的。因为我一直都在注视着您。\n就算您有意隐瞒，我也绝不会看漏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b545a5121c30bf29afe28cb510fbdf7fe8bc80ab64383776a9199351e2503564", "ja": "貴音には敵わないな……。心配かけてすまない。\nどうしても、みんなの公演をいいものにしたくて。", "zh": "真是拿贵音没办法啊……让你担心了，对不起。我只是无论如何都想让大家的演出更加精彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "07015fed65f043b8b166c832e46d2d877f6edf473438c1330d27c839c9d5da0a", "ja": "その気持ちは真、嬉しいのですが……。\n体を壊しては元も子もありませんよ。", "zh": "您的这份心意，实在令我欣喜……可是，若是累坏了身体，便得不偿失了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "8b48edde10e3351c1d260a725f6e330bf95deb5efcdc6f28a41964f295b19ed0", "ja": "あなた様の代わりとなる方はいないのですから、\nどうかご自身を大切にしてくださいませ。", "zh": "没有人能够替代您，\n请务必多保重自己的身体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1b77213be5e12964478867bd9ba50cfe752d554c9ffc90a570798d0f7d369752", "ja": "ありがとう、わかったよ。\nそれじゃ、この後は少し休憩を取ろうかな。", "zh": "谢谢，我知道了。\n那么接下来，我先休息一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "71111ae1bfebd13d8df68252d9584dff297884a34bb25cfa271e4bddd27d5af2", "ja": "ええ、ゆっくりお休みください。\nよろしければ、まっさーじをして差し上げましょうか？", "zh": "嗯，请好好休息。\n如果您不介意的话，要不要让我为您按摩一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1015_p", "source_sha256": "398d46f2eaef421eb4b838e655a8fc8954caef5fec8672463a462eb37a9f98d8", "ja": "マッサージ？　\n貴音、そんな事できたのか？", "zh": "按摩？\n贵音，你还会这个啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "accc7ec379e0e01aee6d0d0f12056bd31d64afd54daf76df71998e5d6ef64490", "ja": "はい。故郷に伝わる、特別な技です。\nじいやから聞いたので、効果は間違いないかと。", "zh": "是的。这是流传于故乡的特殊技艺。\n因为是从管家爷爷那里听来的，所以效果应该不会错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "f2f68c41eeace28655f8bfea672624d95e23eba96ad922b4457225965c9d4b47", "ja": "ただし、普通とは少し違ったツボを刺激するので、\n多少の痛みはお覚悟を。では、少し失礼して……。", "zh": "不过，我要刺激的穴位和普通的有些不同，可能会有点疼，还请您做好心理准备。那么，恕我失礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cf29dfe7735aa577fa780c2094455c257247d38000536d7a7763ac1bb4daa9a9", "ja": "え、痛みって……うぐっ！？", "zh": "诶，疼痛是指……呜咕！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8a26441edd77150c524933dee97b3fc1752a1b60ac23adfba7e346067321e209", "ja": "いたたたあああ！！？", "zh": "好痛痛痛痛啊！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0364_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4f06c4d2697787a8823de82312585c1cbae5aed3ab093085cde7d15e3053f939", "ja": "（その後、嘘のように体はスッキリしたのだが……\n無理は禁物だな。……いろんな意味で）", "zh": "（之后，身体竟然像骗人一样变得神清气爽了……不过，还是不能勉强自己啊。……从各种意义上来说。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
